38	| RHAISTRAT-9011-E003 | Adopt convention-conformant logging in KServe controller | Implementation | RHOAI Serving | P0 |
39	| RHAISTRAT-9011-E004 | Adopt convention-conformant logging in serving runtimes | Implementation | RHOAI Serving | P0 |
40	| RHAISTRAT-9011-E005 | Adopt convention-conformant logging in Data Science Pipelines | Implementation | RHOAI Pipelines | P1 |
