31	
32	## Description
33	
34	The Dashboard (odh-dashboard, the single-pane web console) adopts the
35	platform structured logging convention so its logs are machine-queryable and
36	correlatable with serving and pipelines logs via the correlation id. This
37	directly addresses the support-case pain of correlating one user request
38	across components.
