53	  record is valid JSON conforming to the platform convention schema with all
54	  required fields present (timestamp, level, component, namespace,
55	  correlation id).
56	- Given a user action initiated in the Dashboard, When its logs are queried
57	  by correlation id, Then Dashboard log records for that action are
58	  retrievable by that id.
59	- No remaining ad-hoc (plain text / key=value) log output in Dashboard code
60	  paths covered by this adoption.
61	
