38	# Document the log format and support query examples
39	
40	## Description
41	
42	User-facing documentation describing the platform structured log format and
43	example queries for common support scenarios. This is substantive
44	documentation authoring (new doc topics), so it is a separate docs-authoring
45	epic rather than incidental touch-ups. It is authored after all component
46	adoptions so it documents the log format as actually implemented across the
47	platform.
48	
49	## Scope
50	
51	- Author documentation describing the platform structured log format: the
52	  JSON schema and the required fields (timestamp, level, component,
53	  namespace, correlation id) as emitted in practice by the adopted
54	  components.
55	- Author example queries for common support scenarios, including correlating
56	  one user request across Dashboard, serving, and pipelines components by
57	  correlation id.
58	- Cover per-component notes where log behavior differs (component field
59	  values, deployment modes).
60	
61	## Acceptance Criteria
