64	  fields, matching the actual output of the adopted components.
65	- Example queries for common support scenarios (including cross-component
66	  correlation by correlation id and namespace) are included and verified
67	  against real log output from the adopted components.
68	- The documentation is technically reviewed against the implementations by
69	  someone familiar with the convention and at least one adoption.
70	- Documentation contains no query examples that fail against actual
71	  component log output.
